tion from all stakeholders, including educators, parents, and communities.It is a shared commitment to nurturing the scientific minds of tomorrow.In conclusion, this research signifies the beginning of a new era in primary school science education.It is a testament to the ever-evolving nature of education and its capacity to adapt to the changing needs of society.Quantum teaching embodies the spirit of progress, encouraging us to explore uncharted territories in the pursuit of better, more engaging, and effective educational practices.",
