e holistic picture of how the Mobile Making program supports targeted youth participant outcomes. \n\nSustained Interest in Making. In the post-session forms, youth participants rated their interest in the project they completed during each session on a 5-point Likert scale (1=Strongly disagree and 5=Strongly agree).",
