ty to succeed in academic endeavors)\" (p. 12).\n\nIn a separate research study, Cohen and Phillips (2015) examined an implementation of Khan Academy across Idaho 47 different schools in 33 that focused on personalized learning. Data from 5,309 students between 3 rd and 8 th grade showed positive correlations between the usage of Khan Academy and academic progress (Cohen",
